{"additions":2784,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\n\nPressing `d` on a pull request (PR list or PR detail) pushes a \"diff window\" on top of the GitHub page: the changed files as a tree on the left, the side-by-side diff on the right. `q` / `Esc` returns to the GitHub page with the previous selection intact.\n\nCloses #200\n\n![github demo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/td72/vig/feat/pr-diff-window/assets/demo-github-pr.gif)\n\n## Changes\n\n- **core**: `PageAction::Push` / `Pop` and a window stack in `App`; page-switch keys close every window on their way to the page\n- **config**: a `window \"diff\"` block (the same `layout` / `tabs` / `bind` / `pane` elements and merge rules as a `page`), `ViewAction::Close` / `OpenBrowser` / `CopyUrl`\n- **diff_window**: reuses the Git page's `FileTreePane` / `DiffViewPane`. `gh pr diff` is fetched in the background (REST: no GraphQL points, works for forks), the last diff seen is cached on disk and shown at once, `r` re-fetches. `Esc` clears a search, then steps diff → tree → close; `q` closes outright. `o` / `y` open / copy the PR's Files tab, `e` opens the selected file in `$EDITOR` only when the working tree has it\n- **github**: `\"d\" \"ShowDiff\"` in `pr_list` and `pr_detail`\n- **git**: `files_from_patch` moves to the diff domain (the stash preview reuses it). A confirmed `/` search in the tree / branch list now moves the detail on the Git page too (it did not before)\n- **fixtures**: `gh pr diff` recorded for the newest PRs (diffs over 256 KB are not kept). The PR demo shows merged PRs with `x` and opens #183's diff\n- **docs**: README / README.ja, the guide's GitHub chapter and Config Reference (en / ja) describe `d` and the `window \"diff\"` block\n\n## Tests\n\n- App push / pop, the window's fetch / cache / error / Esc steps / tree-search follow, the loader's `window` block, `d` on the PR list, and the window rendered from the recorded fixtures (isolated process)\n- `cargo test`: 428 passed; clippy / fmt / pre-commit pass\n- `mise run demo:github-pr` re-recorded the GIF (no API calls)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","changedFiles":34,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:41Z","deletions":47,"headRefName":"feat/pr-diff-window","labels":[],"number":202,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABT2MqWw","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nSearch dispatch, close navigation, and concurrent cache writes have unresolved correctness issues.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>4 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/high-v2-light.png\" alt=\"High severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Use unique temporary files for concurrent patch fetches](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/202#discussion_r4358456326) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Honor forced close when clearing search state](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/202#discussion_r4358456380) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Close unplaced-tree diff windows on Escape](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/202#discussion_r4358456420) · New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Prioritize active search input over cursor-mode handling](https://github.com/td72/vig/pull/202#discussion_r4358456462) · New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nAdds a full-width PR diff window to the GitHub page for #200, reusing the Git page’s file tree and side-by-side diff panes.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds window-stack navigation and configurable `window \"diff\"` layouts and keys.\n- Connects PR list/detail actions to background diff fetching, disk caching, and browser/editor shortcuts.\n- Updates bilingual documentation, regression tests, and the fixture-backed demo.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tape/​fixtures/​pr_diff_184.out | Records a small PR diff for replay. |\r\n| tape/​fixtures/​pr_diff_183.out | Records the PR diff used by the demo. |\r\n| tape/​demo-github-pr.tape | Demonstrates diff navigation and search. |\r\n| src/​worktrees/​domain/​stash.rs | Reuses the shared patch parser. |\r\n| src/​main.rs | Registers the diff-window module. |\r\n| src/​github/​state.rs | Opens diff windows and adds fixture-based coverage. |\r\n| src/​github/​pr_diff.rs | Builds PR-specific diff sources and windows. |\r\n| src/​github/​panes/​pr_list.rs | Emits the selected PR’s diff action. |\r\n| src/​github/​panes/​gh_list.rs | Adds optional list-item diff actions. |\r\n| src/​github/​panes/​detail_view/​mod.rs | Supports opening diffs from PR details. |\r\n| src/​github/​mod.rs | Exposes the PR diff module. |\r\n| src/​github/​domain/​disk_cache.rs | Stores and loads cached PR patches. |\r\n| src/​github/​domain/​client.rs | Fetches PR diffs and builds Files-tab URLs. |\r\n| src/​git/​state.rs | Synchronizes details after confirmed searches. |\r\n| src/​git/​domain/​diff.rs | Provides shared unified-patch parsing. |\r\n| src/​fixtures.rs | Records size-limited PR diff fixtures. |\r\n| src/​diff_window/​state.rs | Implements window behavior, fetching, and tests. |\r\n| src/​diff_window/​mod.rs | Exposes the reusable diff window. |\r\n| src/​core/​ui/​status_bar.rs | Renders diff-window headers and status. |\r\n| src/​core/​pane.rs | Adds the PR diff event. |\r\n| src/​core/​page.rs | Adds push/pop page actions. |\r\n| src/​core/​layout.rs | Makes layout configuration cloneable. |\r\n| src/​core/​keymap.rs | Adds window-level actions. |\r\n| src/​core/​config/​merge.rs | Supports merging window configuration. |\r\n| src/​core/​config/​loader.rs | Loads window blocks and tests overrides. |\r\n| src/​core/​app.rs | Manages window stacking and event routing. |\r\n| README.md | Documents PR diff access and shortcuts. |\r\n| docs/​README.ja.md | Adds Japanese PR diff documentation. |\r\n| docs/​guide/​src/​views-github.md | Explains diff-window interactions. |\r\n| docs/​guide/​src/​config-reference.md | Documents window configuration and actions. |\r\n| docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​views-github.md | Explains diff-window interactions in Japanese. |\r\n| docs/​guide/​ja/​src/​config-reference.md | Documents window configuration in Japanese. |\r\n| assets/​demo-github-pr.gif | Updates the recorded PR demonstration. |\r\n| assets/​default.kdl | Defines diff-window defaults and PR bindings. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","submittedAt":"2026-10-23T10:14:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"de41c48c57d3c75337c23bb7921c9855160cdae0"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:16:33Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39937935923/job/120361975276","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:16:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:12:49Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998308/job/120358866211","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:10:16Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998240/job/120358865835","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:11:54Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998308/job/120358865814","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:51Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:13:43Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998308/job/120358866360","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:49Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:13:43Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998308/job/120360841958","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:13:44Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:16:33Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39937935923/job/120361975895","name":"publish","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:16:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:11:33Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998240/job/120358865698","name":"test (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:47Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:12:22Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39936998240/job/120358865918","name":"test (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:08:48Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:16:33Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39937935923/job/120362031299","name":"homebrew","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:16:42Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"}],"title":"✨ GitHub: show a PR's changed files and diff in a full-width window (`d`)"}
